{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 94542, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 66830, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "暗人偶选择攻略（PVE）", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1639891866, "updated_at": 1639896015, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1639896015, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "※标红的为增伤、加速、减防人偶，对伤害有比较明显提升※标紫色的为队长技增强人偶，这类人偶技能大部分都跟原有队长技不冲突※黑色为加盾、回血、吸血、追伤等人偶，对伤害提升不明显1.橙色暗屁孩，NS给予自身", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 1, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5427, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 94542, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">※标红的为增伤、加速、减防人偶，对伤害有比较明显提升</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">※</span>标紫色的为队长技增强人偶，这类人偶技能大部分都跟原有队长技不冲突</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">※黑</span>色为加盾、回血、吸血、追伤等人偶，对伤害提升不明显</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639891971974_13118008.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639891971974_13118008.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>1.橙色暗屁孩，NS给予自身暴击+30%，暴击最终伤害+<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">40%，DS<span>对攻击对象造成debuff爆发（解除1个最初施加的debuff，并根据其效果的种类造成伤害系数×</span><span>300</span><span>伤害），再PVE有鲁邦的情况没什么发挥的人偶，纯PVP人偶给暗刀</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(75,82,91);font-size:14px;text-align:center;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892192600_46171501.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892192600_46171501.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>2.橙色美杜莎，NS50%几率给予敌方2体10秒石化，DS50%几率给予敌方3体20秒石化，队长技给予光属性敌方回避率-10%，纯PVP人偶</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892279015_68049791.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892279015_68049791.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">3.紫色独眼，NS给予攻击最高我方1体暴击+20%，SS给予暗属性攻击力最高我方2体16秒内SS技能伤害+30%，<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;\">NS跟鲁邦重叠没啥用，</span>主要作用是SS技能，RDRB向人偶，给暗双刃或者暗刀提高6连刀伤害，WB中因为冲突用处不大</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892682170_99442348.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892682170_99442348.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">4.紫色暗月月，NS40%几率给予暗属性刀2体10秒觉醒，队长技给予我方暗属性攻击力+7.5%，NS跟鲁邦技能重叠没用，队长技有一定发挥空间，偏RDRB向，给乳贴或者新的RD对策增加全队伤害，WB用处不大，<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">看新的对策队长有没有发挥空间</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892711949_89195418.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892711949_89195418.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">5.紫色傻白，DS给予敌方4体18秒出血（每2秒70伤害），队长技给予暗属性我方SS伤害+7.5%，<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">偏</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">RDRB向，给乳贴或者新的RD对策增加全队伤害，WB用处不大，看新的对策队长有没有发挥空间</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892711950_28947182.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892711950_28947182.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6.紫色老板娘，SS给予敌方1体DS条-3.5%，队长技给予敌方全体攻击力-7.5%，WB中可以给马尔杜克或者暗双刃让BOSS少放DS</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892711950_40124928.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892711950_40124928.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">7.紫色暗奶，SS给予HP剩余最少我方1体10秒不死，DS给予攻击型我方全体20秒狂暴（攻击力+40%并无敌，结束气绝），RD最强增伤人偶，偏RDRB向，给鲁邦大幅增加FT伤害！！WB中也给鲁邦稍微增加FT伤害</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892711952_14109766.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639892711952_14109766.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>8.紫色泡面，NS给予攻击型我方1体10秒暴击率+20%，SS给予攻击力最高我方1体爆伤+30%，跟鲁邦完美冲突，PVE没用的人偶</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639894490865_47924531.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639894490865_47924531.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>9.蓝色小丑，NS给予敌方225无视追加伤害，RDRB中给暗刀稍微增加FT伤害</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639894870662_50306789.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639894870662_50306789.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">10.蓝色吉他，DS给予攻击力最高我方1体20秒内技能伤害+25%（NS SS均适用），这应该是不冲突的增伤，给鲁邦DS增加暗刀FT伤害，偏RDRB向，WB也能用</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895188265_52547743.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895188265_52547743.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">11.蓝色跳窗，SS给予敌方12秒内弱点防御-17.5%，<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">偏RDRB向，给暗兔子或者暗双刃或者主打S的暗辅助天子，全面增伤，WB没啥用</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895188270_3411456.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895188270_3411456.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>12.蓝色秃头，队长技给予暗属性我方</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895436156_15234091.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895436156_15234091.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>13.蓝色提群，SS给予敌方350无视追加伤害，给6连刀<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">或者百分比刀</span>稍微增加点伤害，RD WB通用</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895533885_82400641.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895533885_82400641.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>14.绿色苹果，SS给予敌方500固定<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">追加伤害，偏PVP向人偶，PVE里给6连刀或者百分比刀稍微增加点伤害</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895711548_30752495.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895711548_30752495.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>15.绿色面罩，NS给予自身10秒内SS技能攻击力+20%，看起来没什么刀能用到</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895804959_83464583.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895804959_83464583.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>16.绿色莫扎特，SS给予光属性敌方300追加伤害，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">，给6连刀</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">或者百分比刀</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">稍微增加点伤害，RD WB通用</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895915972_71462085.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639895915972_71462085.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">17.绿色女忍，SS给予光属性敌方300无视追加伤害，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">，给6连刀</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">或者百分比刀</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">稍微增加点伤害，RD WB通用</span><br></span></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 82806, "username": "大花", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 24, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 1, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 114945282, "content_num": 85, "read_num": 465756, "like_num": 318}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id"